WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.089
Jack stared at the woman.

2
00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:17.383
"Your husband is an ogre?" he said.

3
00:00:17.384 --> 00:00:28.064
"Is he the mean ogre who steals gold?"

4
00:00:28.065 --> 00:00:31.054
"Yes!" the woman said.

5
00:00:31.055 --> 00:00:35.117
"He steals gold and treasure from people.

6
00:00:35.118 --> 00:00:41.388
And do you know what his favorite food is?"

7
00:00:41.389 --> 00:00:47.445
Jack shook his head. "No."

8
00:00:47.446 --> 00:00:57.061
"It's baked boys on bread!" the ogre's wife said.

9
00:00:57.062 --> 00:01:00.934
Jack gulped.

10
00:01:00.935 --> 00:01:05.037
"You must get out of here," the woman went on.

11
00:01:05.038 --> 00:01:10.359
"My husband is out hunting now.

12
00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:15.907
But he will return soon and he will eat you!"

13
00:01:15.908 --> 00:01:20.456
Jack knew he should leave at once.

14
00:01:20.457 --> 00:01:24.089
Mother told him stories about the mean ogre.

15
00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:29.268
The ogre stole from people.

16
00:01:29.269 --> 00:01:33.795
And worse—the terrible ogre ate boys!

17
00:01:33.796 --> 00:01:36.848
But Jack's belly was growling.

18
00:01:36.849 --> 00:01:40.483
His knees felt weak.

19
00:01:40.484 --> 00:01:46.279
Jack rubbed his belly again. "Please, ma'am.

20
00:01:46.280 --> 00:01:49.246
I know the ogre could eat me.

21
00:01:49.247 --> 00:01:52.454
But I could die from hunger first.

22
00:01:52.455 --> 00:01:57.078
Please. Can you give me some breakfast?"

23
00:01:57.079 --> 00:01:59.479
The woman shook her head.

24
00:01:59.480 --> 00:02:02.415
"I'm sorry," she said.

25
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:06.553
"But I don't think that's a good idea."

26
00:02:06.554 --> 00:02:10.087
"I will eat fast and leave," Jack begged.

27
00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:14.619
"I promise." He crossed his heart.

28
00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:16.709
"Please?"

29
00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:26.977
The woman stared at Jack for another second.

30
00:02:26.978 --> 00:02:32.163
Finally she let out a loud sigh.

31
00:02:32.164 --> 00:02:50.781
"Fine. Come in," she said.

